# Ignore all custom chart indicators added by the user
*.js

# But keep this .gitignore and the folder README
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Two indicators ship with OpenAlgo as working reference material, so a fresh
# install has real examples to read and modify. Open Range Breakout is the pure
# case: one calc over the chart's own bars. OI Profile is the other half of the
# surface - data the chart has never seen, fetched in `attach`, drawn by its own
# canvas primitive. Anything else you write stays on your own machine.
!open_range_breakout.js
!oi_profile_live.js

# Ignore backup and editor files
*.bak
*.backup
*~

# Keep the directory but ignore its contents beyond the exceptions above.
